"| `NoiseLearnerV3` | Performs noise learning by using both the Pauli-Lindblad and TREX protocols. | 3.3 | [Documentation](/guides/noise-learning) |\n"
"| Local mode | Verifies syntactic correctness and compares the effects of different error mitigation methods. | 3.4 | [Documentation](/guides/local-testing-mode) |\n"
